{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13380","headline":"让皇帝庙乐章 送神 · 李纾","name":"让皇帝庙乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奠献已事，昏昕载分。\n风摇雨散，灵卫絪緼。\n龙驾帝服，已腾五云。\n泮宫复閟，寂寞无闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李纾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}